---
import { links } from "../data/site";
---

<section class="join section-shell" id="join" aria-labelledby="join-title">
  <div class="join-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span>05</span> JOIN HACKSICK</p>
    <h2 id="join-title">JOIN US</h2>
    <p>Event、Community、Create、Collaborate。ひとつの「入会」ではなく、いまのあなたに合う関わり方を選べます。</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/join/">関わり方を見る <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="join-actions">
    <a class="join-card join-card-primary" href={links.connpass} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
      <span>EVENT</span>
      <strong>connpass</strong>
      <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i>
    </a>
    <a class="join-card" href={links.noteAbout} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
      <span>COMMUNITY</span>
      <strong>note</strong>
      <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
